cham3-desktop (0.0.0~m1) UNRELEASED; urgency=low

  * M1 visual and package foundation: Plasma 6 Wayland desktop defaults, dark
    color scheme, wallpaper, branding, look-and-feel package, right-edge
    panel layout and eight inert panel plasmoids.
  * Backend-dependent panel features are reported unavailable; no security
    action is performed by any shipped panel component.
  * dumpcap capture policy (Codex review F3): a dpkg-statoverride, a dpkg
    file trigger on /usr/bin/dumpcap and the postinst/postrm keep dumpcap out
    of set-user-id root and fail closed when file capabilities cannot be set.
    Adds libcap2-bin and adduser to Depends for the maintainer scripts.
  * Maintainer address is a reserved placeholder pending an owner decision.

